  "description": "This spacious two bedroom apartment , with own hall door, is located in a quiet residential development beside Terenure village. There are a superb range of vibrant cafés, restaurants, local boutiques and shops. It is within easy walking distance to the villages of Rathgar and Harold’s Cross. The development is well serviced by public transport to the city centre and and the M50 is close by. \n\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, a large living/dining room with balcony off same, separate fully fitted modern kitchen, 2 double bedrooms and main bathroom. The property comes with one parking space. \n\nStandard features \nParking \nCentral heating , garden/patio/balcony, washing machine, dryer, dishwasher, microwave",
